sdue','Activities due','Aktivitas jatuh tempo',NULL,1795769384,NULL,0,0),(1026,'id',1,'indicator:activitiesdue_help','The user has activities due.','Pengguna memiliki aktivitas jatuh tempo.',NULL,1795769384,NULL,0,0),(1027,'id',1,'indicator:anycourseaccess','Any course access','Setiap akses kursus',NULL,1795769384,NULL,0,0),(1028,'id',1,'indicator:anycourseaccess_help','This indicator reflects access to any course that the user is enrolled in.','Indikator ini menunjukkan akses kursus yang diikuti pengguna',NULL,1795769384,NULL,0,0),(1029,'id',1,'indicator:anywrite','Any write action','Setiap aksi menulis',NULL,1795769385,NULL,0,0),(1030,'id',1,'indicator:anywrite_help','This indicator represents any write (submit) action taken by the student.','Indikator ini mewakili setiap tindakan tulis (ajukan) yang dilakukan oleh siswa.',NULL,1795769385,NULL,0,0),(1031,'id',1,'indicator:anywriteincourse','Any write action in the course','Tindakan menulis apapun dalam kursus',NULL,1795769385,NULL,0,0),(1032,'id',1,'indicator:anywriteincourse_help','This indicator represents any write (submit) action taken by the student in any course activity.','Indikator ini mewakili setiap tindakan tulis (ajukan) yang dilakukan oleh siswa dalam setiap aktivitas kursus.',NULL,1795769385,NULL,0,0),(1033,'id',1,'indicator:completeduserprofile','User profile is completed','Profil pengguna lengkap',NULL,1795769385,NULL,0,0),(1034,'id',1,'indicator:completeduserprofile_help','This indicator represents that the student has completed their user profile.','Indikator ini menunjukkan bahwa siswa telah menyelesaikan profil pengguna mereka.',NULL,1795769385,NULL,0,0),(1035,'id',1,'indicator:completeduserprofiledef','User profile is completed','Profil pengguna sudah lengkap',NULL,1795769385,NULL,0,0),(1036,'id',1,'indicator:completeduserprofiledef_help','The site policies have been agreed to and the user has filled in the following fields: Institution, Department, Address, City, Country, URL.','Kebijakan situs telah disetujui dan pengguna telah mengisi kolom ini: Institusi, Departemen, Alamat, Kota, Negara, URL.',NULL,1795769386,NULL,0,0),(1037,'id',1,'indicator:completionenabled','Completion tracking enabled','Pelacakan penyelesaian diaktifkan',NULL,1795769386,NULL,0,0),(1038,'id',1,'indicator:completionenabled_help','This indicator represents that completion tracking has been enabled for this course.','Indikator ini menunjukkan bahwa pelacakan penyelesaian telah diaktifkan untuk kursus ini.',NULL,1795769386,NULL,0,0),(1039,'id',1,'indicator:nostudent','Student enrolments','Pendaftaran siswa',NULL,1795769386,NULL,0,0),(1040,'id',1,'indicator:nostudent_help','This indicator reflects the availability of students in the course.','Indikator ini mencerminkan ketersediaan siswa dalam kursus.',NULL,1795769386,NULL,0,0),(1041,'id',1,'indicator:noteacher','Teacher availability','Ketersediaan pengajar',NULL,1795769387,NULL,0,0),(1042,'id',1,'indicator:noteacher_help','This indicator reflects the availability of teachers in the course.','Indikator ini mencerminkan bahwa kursus ini tidak memiliki pengajar.',NULL,1795769387,NULL,0,0),(1043,'id',1,'indicator:potentialcognitive','Course potential cognitive depth','Kedalaman potensi kognitif kursus',NULL,1795769387,NULL,0,0),(1044,'id',1,'indicator:potentialcognitive_help','This indicator is based on the potential cognitive depth that could be reached by a student participating in course activities.','Indikator ini didasarkan pada kedalaman potensi kognitif yang dapat dicapai oleh siswa yang mengikuti aktivitas kursus.',NULL,1795769388,NULL,0,0),(1045,'id',1,'indicator:potentialcognitivedef','Course potential cognitive depth','Kedalaman kognitif potensial kursus',NULL,1795769388,NULL,0,0),(1046,'id',1,'indicator:potentialcognitivedef_help','The degree to which the course offers \"deep\" cognitive engagement, e.g. submission of work for feedback, the opportunity to review work by others, and the opportunity to revise and resubmit work.','Sejauh mana kursus tersebut menawarkan keterlibatan kognitif yang \"mendalam\", misalnya. penyerahan karya untuk mendapatkan umpan balik, kesempatan untuk meninjau karya orang lain, dan kesempatan untuk merevisi dan mengirimkan kembali karya.',NULL,1795769388,NULL,0,0),(1047,'id',1,'indicator:potentialcognitivedef_link','Learning_analytics_indicators#Cognitive_depth','Learning_analytics_indicators#Cognitive_depth',NULL,1795769388,NULL,0,0),(1048,'id',1,'indicator:potentialsocial','Course potential social breadth','Kursus potensi luasnya sosial',NULL,1795769389,NULL,0,0),(1049,'id',1,'indicator:potentialsocial_help','This indicator is based on the potential social breadth that could be reached by the student participating in course activities.','Indikator ini didasarkan pada keluasan sosial potensial yang dapat dijangkau oleh siswa yang mengikuti aktivitas kursus.',NULL,1795769389,NULL,0,0),(1050,'id',1,'indicator:potentialsocialdef','Course potential social breadth','Keluasan sosial potensial kursus',NULL,1795769389,NULL,0,0),(1051,'id',1,'indicator:potentialsocialdef_help','The degree to which the course offers \"broad\" social engagement, interacting with other participants and with the community of practice beyond the class.','Derajat keluasan sosial yang ditawarkan, misalnya berinteraksi dengan peserta lain dan dengan komunitas lain di luar kelas.',NULL,1795769389,NULL,0,0),(1052,'id',1,'indicator:potentialsocialdef_link','Learning_analytics_indicators#Social_breadth','Learning_analytics_indicators#Social_breadth',NULL,1795769390,NULL,0,0),(1053,'id',1,'indicator:readactions','Read actions amount','Baca jumlah tindakan',NULL,1795769390,NULL,0,0),(1054,'id',1,'indicator:readactions_help','This indicator represents the number of read (view) actions taken by the student.','Indikator ini menunjukkan jumlah tindakan baca (lihat) yang dilakukan oleh siswa.',NULL,1795769390,NULL,0,0),(1055,'id',1,'indicator:userforumstracking','User is tracking forums','Pengguna me