k tersedia untuk siswa.',NULL,1795769424,NULL,0,0),(1275,'id',1,'modvisiblewithstealth','Availability','Ketersediaan',NULL,1795769424,NULL,0,0),(1276,'id',1,'modvisiblewithstealth_help','* Show on course page: Available to students (subject to any access restrictions which may be set).\r\n* Hide on course page: Not available to students.\r\n* Make available but don\'t show on course page: Available to students if you provide a link. Activities will still appear in the gradebook and other reports.','* Tampilkan di halaman kursus: Tersedia untuk siswa (tunduk pada batasan akses apa pun yang mungkin diatur).\n* Sembunyikan di halaman kursus: Tidak tersedia untuk siswa.\n* Sediakan tetapi jangan tampilkan di halaman kursus: Tersedia untuk siswa jika Anda memberikan tautan. Aktivitas akan tetap muncul di buku nilai dan laporan lainnya.',NULL,1795769424,NULL,0,0),(1277,'id',1,'modvisiblehiddensection','Availability','Ketersediaan',NULL,1795769424,NULL,0,0),(1278,'id',1,'modvisiblehiddensection_help','* Hide on course page: Not available to students.\r\n* Make available but don\'t show on course page: Available to students if you provide a link. Activities will still appear in the gradebook and other reports.','* Sembunyikan di halaman kursus: Tidak tersedia untuk siswa.\n* Sediakan tetapi jangan tampilkan di halaman kursus: Tersedia untuk siswa jika Anda memberikan tautan. Aktivitas akan tetap muncul di buku nilai dan laporan lainnya.',NULL,1795769424,NULL,0,0),(1279,'id',1,'moodlelogo','Moodle logo','Logo Moodle',NULL,1795769425,NULL,0,0),(1280,'id',1,'month','Month','Bulan',NULL,1795769425,NULL,0,0),(1281,'id',1,'months','Months','Bulan',NULL,1795769425,NULL,0,0),(1282,'id',1,'modified','Modified','Diubah',NULL,1795769425,NULL,0,0),(1283,'id',1,'moduleintro','Description','Deskripsi',NULL,1795769425,NULL,0,0),(1284,'id',1,'modulesetup','Setting up module tables','Membuat tabel modul',NULL,1795769425,NULL,0,0),(1285,'id',1,'modulesuccess','{$a} tables have been set up co